{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50871","headline":"省题诗二十一首 原隰荑绿柳 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 原隰荑绿柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴郊浮淑气，疎柳发柔荑。\n嫩翠原头徧，巨丝隰畔低。\n和烟方郁郁，伴草欲萋萋。\n叶少眉难短，条新带未齐。\n离人心已醉，游客步初迷。\n无限迁乔意，芳菲正好栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}